  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">這款</span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-spawn-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>凋零生成修復</strong></a> </span><span style=\"color:#fff\">模組解決了一個常見問題：當小型方塊（如雪層、按鈕、地毯和植物）干擾凋零祭壇時，會導致凋零無法生成。</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">然而，原始修復與</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"> <a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-spawn-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>凋零生成動畫</strong></a></span><span style=\"color:#fff\">模組不相容，同時使用兩者會完全破壞動畫效果。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>本模組正是為此而生。</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>凋零生成修復 W.S.A. 相容版</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">讓你在啟用生成修復的同時，<em>依然能保留</em>凋零祭壇的動畫效果</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1382208/description_186bf1a2-3ec6-4b26-8e30-9524ab489e1a.gif\" alt=\"凋零生成動畫與凋零生成修復共同運作示意\" width=\"476\" height=\"268\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">相容方塊類型：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">按鈕</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">蠟燭</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">地毯</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">雪層</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">小型植物與花朵</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">花盆</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">及其他...</span></li>\n</ul><p><em>使用本模組需注意：</em></p><ul>\n<li><em>必須安裝凋零生成動畫模組</em></li>\n<li><em><strong>不可</strong>安裝原始版凋零生成修復模組</em></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwither-spawn-fix-wsa-compatible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 下載頁面</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/eFjWWvNphY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ITIIVc1.jpeg\" alt=\"Discord 社群邀請\" width=\"358\" height=\"98\"></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/boboMCmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EGs51Y.png\" alt=\"Patreon 贊助連結\" width=\"360\" height=\"96\"></span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbo_bo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J5FW8zh.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi 贊助連結\" width=\"366\" height=\"74\"></span></a></p>",
